; Rescued, not a starter: the Last Bridge's chapter wizard, freed from her barge under the span
; (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.9). The enchantress of Avalon, the queen in the barge who carried the dying king
; over the water to be healed; she opens on Sleet Runes, the cold off the strait cast the way she faces (R2: a
; freed wizard may open on a two-element spell). Her passive is Avalon - the first extra life a run spends heals
; to full, not half - the one axis no other wizard owns: what an extra life is worth.
